    <string name="mode_standard_title">Automatic</string>
    <string name="mode_standard_body">Uses Accessibility to notice the moment you tap “Copy”. It doesn’t read your screen. Works in most apps.</string>
    <string name="mode_standard_action">Open Accessibility settings</string>
    <string name="mode_standard_hint">Find “Syncliko automatic sending” (on Samsung: Installed apps) and turn it on. If the switch is greyed out, open App info → ⋮ → Allow restricted settings, then try again.</string>
